 "summary": "Northwind Labs, Inc. engages Sofia Lindqvist as an independent contractor for machine learning infrastructure consulting for six months from July 22, 2026, at $95 per hour with total fees capped at $40,000 absent written approval. Northwind may terminate at any time on 60 days' notice, pays invoices within 45 days, and the contract is governed by California law but lacks confidentiality and liability cap provisions."
